<view class="page"><view class="title">课时账本</view><view class="subtitle">每笔扣课与返还，都有据可循</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="notice">请先在工作台选择体验身份。</view><block wx:else><button class="secondary" bindtap="download" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">导出CSV明细</button><view class="notice">累计账面包含已到期记录；当前可用课时请看学员档案。导出会打开微信文件分享面板，由你选择保存或发送。</view><view wx:for="{{entries}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="card-title">{{item.student_name}} · {{item.label}}</view><text class="{{item.delta<0?'negative':'positive'}}">{{item.change}}次</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.package_name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="line row muted"><text>{{item.time}} · {{item.actor_name}}</text><text>累计 {{item.balance}}次</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!entries.length}}" class="empty">暂无课时记录</view></block></view>
